@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #36546A
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Наблюдаемость — одна country cell; повторяется в NG / KE
rectangle "API / worker / PostgreSQL / Redis" as app
rectangle "Country ingress / public CDN metrics" as edge
rectangle "OpenTelemetry Collector\nredaction + sampling + limits" as otel
rectangle "Prometheus\n30d" as prom
rectangle "Loki\nmasked logs 14d" as logs
rectangle "Tempo\ntraces 7d" as traces
rectangle "Grafana / SLI calculation\nпо стране и PSP" as dash
rectangle "Alertmanager\nburn rate / P1" as alert
actor "Primary → Secondary → CTO" as oncall
rectangle "Global CEO summary\nтолько безопасные агрегаты" as global
app --> otel : metrics / spans / logs
edge --> prom : eligible / good / bad
app --> prom : scrape saturation
otel --> prom : metrics
otel --> logs : masked logs
otel --> traces : sampled spans
prom --> dash : SLIs / golden signals
logs --> dash : incident correlation
traces --> dash : causal trace
prom --> alert : rules
alert --> oncall : country / incident ID, без PII
dash --> global : aggregates, legal gate
note bottom of app
Raw PII, IP, phone и реквизиты не экспортируются.
Telemetry outage = unknown / alert, а не 100% availability.
end note
@enduml
